      "cooked": "<p>Hello !<br>\n<br>\nI thought it would be great to have an up-to-date&nbsp;\"hive mind tier list\"</p>\n<p>So I created a quick google forms that I wanted to share here;<br>\n<a href=\"https://forms.gle/bky1mFgTviWUr9bM9\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">https://forms.gle/bky1mFgTviWUr9bM9</a></p>\n<p><br>\nI did not ask for any login or email, I don't think it would be profitable for anyone to spam answers, and didn't want to \"block\" people out who would be willing to share their opinion !</p>\n<p>I intend to compile these in a few days and make it a little more visual. I'll also link it to the Spirit Island Discord, Reddit and BGG's forums.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>EDIT: Getting close to&nbsp;100 answers, here's what it currently looks like (see attachments)<br>\n&nbsp;</p>",
