      "created_at": "2020-11-18T20:30:04.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Funny you put Keeper in A tier while it's the only one sitting very comfortably&nbsp;in S+ with the current 40 votes out of 67 entries ;)<br>\n<br>\nSo far I have no major surprise except may be seeing Spread more around S than S+, leaving Keeper alone there.</p>\n<p>Volcano is also one that ends up higher than I expected him to be.&nbsp;</p>",
