      "created_at": "2020-11-18T21:48:51.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Huh, now that I thought&nbsp;about it, I was probably being too rough on Keeper. So I went and submited an entry that was blank&nbsp;except for&nbsp;Keeper on S Tier.</p>\n<p>I wonder&nbsp;why Keeper is so much \"better\" than everyone else, though.</p>\n<p>Yeah, Volcano's Explosive Eruption innate power and growth options seem&nbsp;pretty good, while Mountain Home seems negligible&nbsp;(I have not played it yet, so I can say nothing for sure).</p>",
